    "svgcontent": "<svg width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:html=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><g><title>Layer 1</title><rect id=\"svg_61c84177-45e6-4553-ad42-fd0c3f2db1ff\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#141c26\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_05a917b4-8991-4768-97dc-2d3409fcd8d5\" x=\"20\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">LOAD SHEDDING</text><text id=\"svg_7e151d33-e0ef-4c6c-bcf3-93b6e3e5a503\" x=\"20\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Switch a unit to SHED to cut its power. The light shows the real state: green = running, red = shed / off. A unit switched back on restarts after a 3 s lock-out.</text><g id=\"HXB_3ff0916c-d43f-4875-9d07-63a4520d1308\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_d2f89524-0f13-4b05-adaa-238de873f52c\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_763b6145-7a71-4551-9c29-1accf61d78c0\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_20f4bbcc-f01d-4ef5-b9ce-b7b777a111ea\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Overview</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_4585071e-8c18-486d-b2ae-217763739eb8\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_a48b9d09-2396-4548-b591-cf36e7df43f5\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_41d8d1f2-98b4-486f-8ac7-3e9f5113404a\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_dd0b13a6-c992-4004-bea9-b67dff00312c\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Energy</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_b93b6146-e19a-42b3-89fa-a93e25e81379\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_925faf24-c120-4b2b-9513-17e94980f31c\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_ccb6afe9-ca91-45ac-a9dd-407b1d0be7af\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_68dff68d-ddd1-43e0-b6f6-489c69e0304c\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Mechanism setup</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><rect id=\"svg_edbb36bc-9617-487e-933f-72dd9f1d19af\" x=\"20\" y=\"74\" width=\"380\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_5ed105e2-fc6f-4d22-ae87-3cc86fdb312b\" x=\"36\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">TOTAL POWER (kW)</text><g id=\"VAL_dce8663b-47ea-41b9-a2db-4d436bbcffc2\" type=\"svg-ext-value\" fill=\"#4da3ff\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke-width=\"0\" text-anchor=\"start\"><text id=\"VAL_5e3781e7-6f60-4979-8996-58f0d15388d0\" x=\"36\" y=\"126\" fill=\"#4da3ff\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">#0.0</text></g><rect id=\"svg_953e30e4-b2ec-44e2-bba2-feb903db3e5f\" x=\"413\" y=\"74\" width=\"380\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_f49a2156-924b-4a45-86e4-0d8373a05bd6\" x