    "svgcontent": "<svg width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:html=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><g><title>Layer 1</title><rect id=\"svg_d82b40e8-ff80-4103-a242-43eebc12c0cc\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#141c26\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_5cecc91a-0305-4394-aab6-a33fd38c4446\" x=\"20\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">MECHANISM SETUP</text><g id=\"HXB_e5567d9a-cd2a-487d-b840-5fb90a7fed01\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_ed239681-a9a9-42ab-a546-e4e5737cd82a\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_f78395e3-4317-4ce8-9710-9963f0ca594f\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_a3917f46-1ca2-408c-9146-bca82e4db89f\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Overview</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_0b5c98db-d032-4171-9195-4a41984fbd61\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_0b28f205-6501-4f1b-8994-9a0f2e010682\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_6941534c-e5a2-4705-8151-c1a4ed720d10\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_a2d6fb3d-7f72-43ce-ab28-e170fe82d486\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Energy</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_ef4ec73a-7c86-4618-8ac0-2e3c9f694732\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_740dc2e1-90f7-4320-bd75-21336dea52a1\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_cbd454f1-8b5e-40a1-bcfc-684b01bb3f22\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_f7910038-6c6e-463c-a9a5-fd3d1a9d26ec\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Load shedding</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_a7b95c75-70a8-4859-9bbd-6e8f5ba3f46a\" x=\"20\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Adjust the simulated mechanisms; every axis follows the virtual master axis (position = ratio \u00d7 master + phase + cam).</text><rect id=\"svg_de0c87e9-9b13-4017-b5fa-a9d211b84e11\" x=\"20\" y=\"74\" width=\"1560\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_60cf518d-ccba-4103-b7c0-4245ef30930c\" x=\"40\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Master speed (rpm)</text><g id=\"HXI_7cfc40f0-96aa-4ee5-89f3-0d04ba3b59db\" type=\"svg-ext-html_input\" stroke=\"#000000\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f1f1f1ff\"><rect id=\"svg_1a2dc6bb-f8e7-46d3-aad2-4d9586ccd98e\" x=\"200\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"null\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXI_4a7c8a5c-a712-4e08-8c61-b941d0469ccd\" x=\"200\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><INPUT id=\"I-HXI_4772cf55-da42-48dc-a5c4-03bb5da33a29\" style=\"width: calc(100% - 7px); height: calc(100% - 7px); text-align: right; border: unset; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\" type=\"text\"/></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_38b7f444-0250-4cbb-aa53-92e289e641b3\" x=\"310\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Actual</text><g id=\"VAL_fc31171d-8051-40fa-9f2f-8541685d16ec\" type=\"svg-ext-value\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke-width=\"0\" text-anchor=\"end\"><text id=\"VAL_cc696d6e-5b5b-4c7a-86c4-225ff299c9f8\" x=\"400\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">###0.0</text></g><g id=\"HXB_b75cebbc-8166-4a7e-a4d2-6fee7773b2f9\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_591b2411-a30f-40da-91fc-9d28b0aa8b31\" x=\"460\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#27ae60\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_92c92a78-1e0a-4872-b967-d83a3bfbdc92\" x=\"460\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_8881a4e2-6a1f-4bed-9486-ba5e91164aa8\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #27ae60; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">RUN</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_09911d21-4d70-4e76-ad0c-692743faf241\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_aaebb703-cca2-41af-a704-9143051f90bc\" x=\"560\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_bd53aa5c-fa18-4303-adb8-547fcbdc0182\" x=\"560\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_1f5a6f1c-b6c7-47f5-8247-04978ba236c6\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #c0392b; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">STOP</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_60bb5973-b51e-4f14-a9bd-48ed3a53339d\" x=\"40\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Fault injection: raise Imbalance / Looseness / BearingWear / Misalignment (0 = healthy \u2026 1 = severe) and watch the Overview.</text><rect id=\"svg_72b1ce73-2544-44c9-9594-177464f9d876\" x=\"20\" y=\"156\" width=\"300\" height=\"508\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><rect id=\"svg_e45728af-6e75-4f3f-9727-21f56b10a967\" x=\"20\" y=\"156\" width=\"6\" height=\"508\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4da3ff\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_b942644c-dffb-445f-a988-cce478306862\" x=\"40\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">AXIS 1</text><text id=\"svg_ba5951b4-c564-40b4-b268-e71487fab1d4\" x=\"40\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Enabled (1/0)</text><g id=\"HXI_f2297655-4337-4e48-971c-d1f4d246f6d9\" type=\"svg-ext-html_input\" stroke=\"#000000\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f1f1f1ff\"><rect id=\"svg_ae0ee2d2-35bc-4d10-b4b0-d44135fb82cc\" x=\"210\" y=\"208\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"null\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXI_4ac7db4f-2dd5-4138-b614-b1ba89b2b5ac\" x=\"210\" y=\"208\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><INPUT id=\"I-HXI_7ff0e1c3-0e48-4b2e-a753-f257be8f0d9a\" style=\"width: calc(100% - 7px); height: calc(100% - 7px); text-align: right; border: unset; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\" type=\"text\"/></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_3abd2725-5e63-4f0e-afaf-c1855f17d4dc\" x=\"40\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Gear ratio<